      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks, this is a really strong start. it feels very professional.\n\ncan you make it a little bit shorter though? my director is the type of person who skims through long emails, so i want to get straight to the point. \n\nalso, i want to touch on the *way* these requirements are coming in. it's not just that they're new, it's that they're sort of... stealthy. they aren't coming through the official channels, so they just kind of creep in and take over the sprint without anyone properly noticing until it's too late. can you add a line that captures how these things just sort of sneak under the radar and sabotage our capacity?",
      "source": "evaluator"
